#. Add-on summary/title, usually the user visible name of the add-on
#. Translators: Summary/title for this add-on
#. to be shown on installation and add-on information found in add-on store
msgid "NusaNewsID - Indonesian News Reader"
msgstr "NusaNewsID - Pembaca Berita Indonesia"

msgid "Follows Indonesian news from Antara, Kompas, Detik, Republika, Liputan6, Merdeka, CNN Indonesia and WinPoin. It announces new stories in the background, stays quiet during the hours you choose, and opens whole articles in an accessible window, so you do not need a browser."
msgstr "Mengikuti berita Indonesia dari Antara, Kompas, Detik, Republika, Liputan6, Merdeka, CNN Indonesia, dan WinPoin. Add-on ini mengumumkan berita baru di latar belakang, diam selama jam yang Anda pilih, dan membuka isi artikel di jendela yang mudah dibaca, tanpa perlu browser."

#. Brief changelog for this version
#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
msgid ""
"\n"
"- Merdeka works again. The add-on finds its articles at Merdeka's new web addresses.\n"
"- Antara works again inside NVDA. Its certificate is checked against the certificates that come with NVDA, so the \"CERTIFICATE_VERIFY_FAILED\" error is gone, and certificate errors are no longer retried.\n"
"- Titles are clean and times are exact. Stories come from each site's RSS feed when the feed is kept up to date, and from its pages otherwise.\n"
"- Each story stays in the category it was listed under. Sidebars, \"popular\" boxes and other sections of a page are left out.\n"
"- Stories older than the storage period are skipped, so old news is no longer announced as new.\n"
"- A story reads the same in the list, in notifications and in the reader: title first, then source, category and time. \"Breaking\" comes first only for breaking news, and \"Unread\" comes last only for unread stories. Brackets, bars and dashes are gone.\n"
"- Times read like \"14 minutes ago\" or \"3 hours ago\" during the first day, and as a date and time after that. The newest stories come first.\n"
"- The reader shows the title, the source and category, the publication time and the link on separate lines. \"Copy story\" copies only the title and the text.\n"
"- Several new stories are announced in one message, so a braille display shows all of them. The message names the key that opens the news list, including a key you set in Input Gestures.\n"
"- The first check after installing, or after deleting saved stories, saves the stories quietly and says how many it loaded. Stories saved by older versions are marked read once.\n"
"- The add-on is faster. It keeps stories in memory, saves them shortly after a change, and stores article texts separately. Old stories are removed after every check, and the list no longer stops at 500 stories.\n"
"- From NVDA 2026.3, the settings are the same in every configuration profile.\n"
"- The settings are grouped and labelled. Sources are a list of check boxes, quiet hours must be times such as 22:00, and NVDA's own dialog confirms deleting saved stories.\n"
"- The news list has a label, keeps your place when new stories arrive, and reads a story only once when you come back from the reader. Refresh is now Alt+R.\n"
"- Breaking news now means disasters and emergencies only. Words such as \"presiden\" no longer mark ordinary stories as breaking, so those stories stay quiet during quiet hours.\n"
"- The disability category matches whole words only.\n"
"- Tempo and MacPoin are removed. Tempo refuses connections from the add-on, and MacPoin has published nothing since March 2024.\n"
"- Detik and Republika no longer list politics, and Republika no longer lists entertainment, because the sites stopped updating those sections.\n"
"- Refresh no longer starts a second check, so stories are no longer announced twice. After a refresh, NVDA says how many new stories it found.\n"
"- Closing NVDA or reloading add-ons no longer waits for a news check to finish.\n"
"- On secure screens, such as the Windows sign-in screen, the news list no longer opens.\n"
"- The add-on's messages are now written in English, with an Indonesian translation that NVDA uses when its language is Indonesian.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"- Merdeka kembali berfungsi. Add-on menemukan artikelnya di alamat web Merdeka yang baru.\n"
"- Antara kembali berfungsi di dalam NVDA. Sertifikatnya diperiksa dengan sertifikat bawaan NVDA, jadi error \"CERTIFICATE_VERIFY_FAILED\" tidak muncul lagi, dan error sertifikat tidak lagi dicoba ulang.\n"
"- Judul berita bersih dan waktunya tepat. Berita diambil dari feed RSS situs jika feed-nya terus diperbarui, dan dari halaman situs jika tidak.\n"
"- Setiap berita tetap di kategori tempat ia tercantum. Kotak samping, kotak \"populer\", dan bagian lain di halaman tidak ikut diambil.\n"
"- Berita yang lebih tua dari batas penyimpanan dilewati, jadi berita lama tidak lagi diumumkan sebagai berita baru.\n"
"- Satu berita dibacakan dengan cara yang sama di daftar, di notifikasi, dan di pembaca artikel: judul dulu, lalu sumber, kategori, dan waktu. \"Breaking\" ada di depan hanya untuk berita breaking, dan \"Belum dibaca\" ada di akhir hanya untuk berita yang belum dibaca. Tanda kurung siku, garis vertikal, dan garis minus sudah tidak ada.\n"
"- Waktu dibacakan seperti \"14 menit lalu\" atau \"3 jam lalu\" pada hari pertama, lalu berupa tanggal dan jam. Berita terbaru ada di atas.\n"
"- Pembaca artikel menampilkan judul, sumber dan kategori, waktu terbit, dan link, masing-masing di baris sendiri. \"Salin berita\" hanya menyalin judul dan isi berita.\n"
"- Beberapa berita baru diumumkan dalam satu pesan, jadi semuanya tampil di layar braille. Pesan itu menyebut tombol pembuka daftar berita, termasuk tombol yang Anda atur di Input Gestures.\n"
"- Pemeriksaan pertama setelah add-on dipasang, atau setelah berita tersimpan dihapus, menyimpan berita tanpa mengumumkannya satu per satu, lalu menyebut jumlah berita yang dimuat. Berita yang disimpan versi lama ditandai dibaca sekali.\n"
"- Add-on lebih cepat. Berita disimpan di memori, ditulis ke disk sesaat setelah ada perubahan, dan isi artikel disimpan terpisah. Berita lama dihapus setiap kali pemeriksaan selesai, dan daftar tidak lagi berhenti di 500 berita.\n"
"- Mulai NVDA 2026.3, pengaturan sama di semua profil konfigurasi.\n"
"- Pengaturan dikelompokkan dan diberi label. Sumber berita berupa daftar kotak centang, jam sunyi harus berupa jam seperti 22:00, dan penghapusan berita tersimpan dikonfirmasi dengan dialog NVDA sendiri.\n"
"- Daftar berita punya label, tetap di berita yang sama saat berita baru masuk, dan hanya membacakan berita satu kali saat Anda kembali dari pembaca artikel. Segarkan sekarang Alt+G.\n"
"- Berita breaking sekarang hanya tentang bencana dan keadaan darurat. Kata seperti \"presiden\" tidak lagi membuat berita biasa ditandai breaking, jadi berita itu tetap diam selama jam sunyi.\n"
"- Kategori Disabilitas hanya mencocokkan kata utuh.\n"
"- Tempo dan MacPoin dihapus. Tempo menolak koneksi dari add-on, dan MacPoin tidak menerbitkan apa pun sejak Maret 2024.\n"
"- Detik dan Republika tidak lagi punya kategori Politik, dan Republika tidak lagi punya Entertainment, karena situsnya berhenti memperbarui bagian itu.\n"
"- Segarkan tidak lagi memulai pemeriksaan kedua, jadi berita tidak lagi diumumkan dua kali. Setelah Segarkan, NVDA menyebut jumlah berita baru yang ditemukan.\n"
"- Menutup NVDA atau memuat ulang add-on tidak lagi menunggu pemeriksaan berita selesai.\n"
"- Di layar aman, seperti layar masuk Windows, daftar berita tidak lagi terbuka.\n"
"- Pesan add-on sekarang ditulis dalam bahasa Inggris, dengan terjemahan Indonesia yang dipakai NVDA jika bahasanya bahasa Indonesia.\n"
